{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Collection Item","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404024","type":"Type"}],"id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/library/7733","identified_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"call number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300311706"}],"content":"TR681.W6 M3 1978","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"repository number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404621"}],"content":"7733","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"preferred term","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670"}],"content":"Emergence  ","type":"Name"}],"produced_by":{"carried_out_by":[{"_label":"Cynthia MacAdams","id":"actor/macadams-cynthia","type":"Actor"},{"_label":"Dutton","id":"actor/dutton","type":"Actor"}],"timespan":{"_label":"c1977","type":"TimeSpan"},"type":"Production"},"referred_to_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe Personal Library.\nDamaged mailing label from Chelsea House publishers to Georgia O'Keeffe found in front of book. Discarded.\nEphemera found in front of book : typed press release from Chelsea House Publishers for Emergence.\nFrom Georgia O'Keeffe's Ghost Ranch library.","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"inscription statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435414"}],"content":"abq copy : good condition.|grl copy : good condition ; dust jacket : good condition.|SColl abq : Inscription on t.p. from Cynthia [MacAdams] to Georgia [O'Keeffe], undated : for georgia / with love / cynthia.|SColl grl : Inscription on t.p. from Cynthia [MacAdams] to Georgia [O'Keeffe], undated : dear georgia / sorry we missed each other - / I did so want your energy in this book. / I even came begging at your gates in Abiquiu. / Anyway, celebrate / a birth / love / cynthia.","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}